    "difficulty": 13,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Bruiser</h3>\n<p><em>A thickly muscled and tattooed pirate with melon-sized fists.</em>\n<strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Plunder, raid, smash, terrorize</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 13 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 8/15 | <strong>HP:</strong> 5 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +1 | Weapon: Melee | 2d6 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Sailor +2</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Swashbuckler - Passive</strong>: When the Tough marks 2 or fewer HP from an attack within Melee, the attacker must <strong>mark a Stress</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Clear the Decks - Action</strong>: Make an attack against a target within Very Close. On success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to move into Melee with the target, deal 3d4 physical damage, and knock the target to Close.</p>\n",
